  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Mobile Kit connects this Lens to an app on your phone over Bluetooth.
    On your phone, open the Mobile Kit sample app, bond it with your SPECS once in the SPECS App, then start a session.
    The log in front of you shows each test as it runs: data, app digest, echo and subscription, then a remote image and mesh sent by the phone appear.
